<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rom</book>
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rom</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawl, Jesu Kri ih tamna, Sithaw tamthanglok hoih pongah, pahoe ih kami ah kaom, patoeh ih kami ah kawk ih kami mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(to tamthanglok hoih loe kaciim Cabunawk thungah angmah ih tahmaanawk rang hoiah anih mah tangsuek na hoi lokkamhaih to sak boeh,)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />taksa ah David ih atii ah kaom, a Capa aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih tamthang to;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Muithla ciimcaihaih baktiah, duekhaih thung hoi angthawk moe, thacakhaih hoiah Sithaw Capa ni, tiah taphong:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih ih ahmin pongah, prae kaminawk boih mah lok to tahngaih o moe, tanghaih tawnh o thai hanah, anih rang hoiah ni tahmenhaih hoi patoeh ih kaminawk mah sak ih tok to a hnuk o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nangcae doeh Jesu Kri mah kawk ih kami ah nathum o toeng boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sithaw mah palung moe, kaciim kami ah oh han kawk ih, Rom vangpui ah kaom kaminawk boih khaeah, Aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri khae ih monghaih hoi tahmenhaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmaloe koekah, na tang o haih to long pum ah thuih o boeh pongah, Jesu Kri rang hoiah nangcae boih han, Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lok ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Boeng ai ah nangcae han lawk ka thuih toepsoep, ka palungthin boih hoiah kahoih a Capa ih tamthanglok to ka thuih, tiah a tok ka sak pae ih Sithaw mah panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sithaw koehhaih hoiah nangcae khae angzoh thai hanah, lawk ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thoemto Muithla tangqum nangcae han pazet moe, hnukkhuem ah tha na cak o thai hanah, nangcae hnuk han ka koeh parai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To tiah ni aicae mah tanghaih bangah maeto hoi maeto tha angpaek o thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kalah Gentelnawk khaeah athaih ka pakhrik baktih toengah, nangcae khaeah doeh athaih ka pakhrik thai toeng hanah, nangcae ohhaih ahmuen ah angzoh han kam sak khing boeh, (toe vaihi khoek to pakaakung oh vop,) tiah panoeksak han ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai loe Grik kaminawk, tuinuen kaham kaminawk, palungha kaminawk hoi palungha ai kaminawk khaeah doeh laiba ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />To pongah, Rom vangpui ah kaom nangcae khaeah doeh, ka thuih thai tawk kahoih tamthanglok to thuih hanah ka koeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kri ih kahoih tamthanglok pongah azathaih ka tawn ai: kahoih tamthanglok loe tang kaminawk boih pahlong hanah, Sithaw thacakhaih ah oh, hmaloe koekah Judahnawk hanah oh, to pacoengah Gentelnawk han doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Katoeng kami loe tanghaih hoiah hing tih, tiah tarik ih oh baktih toengah, tanghaih rang hoiah kaom Sithaw toenghaih loe, tanghaih rang hoiah ni amtueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sithaw palungphuihaih loe van bang hoiah Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk, katoeng ai kaminawk hoi loktang to katoeng ai ah patoh kaminawk boih khaeah amtueng boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sithaw mah nihcae khaeah hnuksak pongah, panoek han koi Sithaw ih hmuennawk to nihcae khaeah amtueng pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Long oh tangsuek na hoi amtueng ai hmuennawk to kamtueng ah hnuk thai boeh, dungzan a thacakhaih hoi Sithaw ah ohhaih to, a sak ih hmuenawk rang hoiah kamtueng ah panoek boeh pongah, a sak o ih zaehaih to nihcae mah angphat o thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nihcae loe Sithaw panoek o, toe Anih to Sithaw baktiah pakoeh o ai, kawnhaih lok doeh thui o ai; nihcae poekhaih loe tidoeh avang ai, nihcae amthuhaih palung loe khoving baktiah tahmuep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Angmacae hoi angmacae to palungha kami ah poek o, toe nihcae loe kamthu kami ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amro thai ai Sithaw lensawkhaih to amro thaih kami baktiah sakcop ih krang, tavaanawk, khok palito kaom moinawk hoi long ah kavak hmuennawk baktiah a sak pakhraih o ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />To pongah angmacae zae sak koehhaih palungthin baktih toengah, angmacae hoi angmacae salakah angmacae ih takpum to azatsak hanah, Sithaw mah nihcae han kaciim ai poekhaih to paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nihcae loe loktang Sithaw to amsawn lok hoiah athlaeng o ving moe, dungzan tahamhoihaih ah kaom, Sahkung pongah, sak ih hmuen to a bok o lat. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hae pongah Sithaw mah nihcae khaeah kasae sak koehhaih palungthin to paek: nongpatanawk loe sakzong ih hmuen baktiah sah o ai ah, sakzong ai ih hmuen to a sak o lat:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />to baktih toengah nongpanawk mah doeh, nongpata hoi angkom zonghaih to pahnawt o moe, maeto hoi maeto zae sak koehhaih palungthin hmai baktiah bet o pongah, azat kaom hmuen ah kaom nongpa hoi nongpa zaehaih to a sak o, to tiah a sakpazae o ih hmuen baktih toengah nihcae mah atho to hnuk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nihcae loe Sithaw panoek han koeh o ai pongah, sak kahoih ai hmuennawk to saksak hanah, Sithaw mah kamro poekhaih to nihcae hanah paek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nihcae loe zaehaih congca, toeng ai ah khosakhaih, zu sava laep ah nongpa hoi nongpata zae sakhaih, poeksethaih, kamthlai hmoek koehhaih, hnukmahaih, uthaih, humhaih, angaekhaih, alinghaih, poeksethaih, kami pronghaih hoiah koi o,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ahmin kasae thui kami, Sithaw hnuma kami, kami khet patoek kami, poeksang kami, amoek kami, kahoih ai hmuennawk sah kami, amno hoi ampa lok tahngai ai kami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />panoek thai ai kami, oepthok ai kami, amlunghaih tawn ai kami, misa koeh kami, palungnathaih tawn ai kami ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />To baktih toksah kami loe duek han krak, tiah Sithaw lokcaekhaih to nihcae mah panoek o, toe nihcae loe to baktih hmuennawk sak khue to khawt ai, to baktih hmuen sak hanah kaminawk to thapaek o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah, nang, minawk lokcaekkung, nangmah to doeh na hoikhang ai, minawk lokcaekkung, nang mah doeh to tiah na sak toeng pongah, minawk lok na caek naah nangmah hoi nangmah zaehaih angnet kami ah ni na oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toe to baktih hmuen sah kaminawk loe Sithaw mah loktang lok baktih toengah lokcaekhaih to om tih, tiah a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw kami, to baktih hmuen sah kami lokcaekkung, nang doeh to baktih hmuen to na sak toeng pongah, Sithaw lokcaekhaih thung hoi ka loih tih, tiah na poek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To tih ai boeh loe Sithaw hoihhaih mah dawnpakhuem hanah ang caeh haih, tito panoek ai ah, Sithaw angraenghaih ah kaom a hoihhaih, pauephaih hoi paroeai palungsawkhaih to na patoek maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe nang loe palung na thah moe, dawnpakhuemhaih na tawn ai. Sithaw palungphuihaih ni to phak moe, katoeng a lokcaekhaih amtueng na han ih maw, nangmah hanah to palungphuihaih to na patungh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sithaw loe a sak o ih baktih toengah kami boih hanah paek tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />kahoih hmuen sah kami, lensawkhaih, khingyahaih hoi amro thai ai hmuen pakrong kaminawk hanah loe dungzan hinghaih to paek tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />toe angmah taham pakrong kami, loktang lok tahngai ai kami, toenghaih loklam to pahnawt moe, zaehaih loklam pazui kaminawk nuiah loe palungphuihaih to om tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kahoih ai hmuen sah kaminawk nuiah loe patangkhanghaih hoi palungsethaih to om tih, Judahnawk khaeah om hmaloe ueloe, Gentelnawk khaeah doeh om tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />toe kahoih hmuen sah kaminawk loe lensawkhaih, khingyahaih hoi monghaihnawk to hnu o tih, Judahnawk khaeah om hmaloe ueloe, Gentelnawk khaeah doeh om tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sithaw loe kami ih mikhmai to khen ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaalok ai ah zaehaih sah kaminawk loe, kaalok ai ah amro o tih: kaalok thungah zaehaih sah kaminawk loe kaalok mah lokcaek tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />(kaalok thaih kaminawk loe Sithaw hmaa ah katoeng kami ah om thai ai, kaalok pazui kaminawk khue ni katoeng kami ah om o tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gentelnawk loe kaalok tawn o ai, toe angmacae koehah kaalok to pazui o naah, kaalok tawn o ai e, nihcae hanah kaalok ah oh pae boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kasae kahoih panoekhaih loe nihcae palung thungah tarik ih kaalok baktiah oh pae boeh, to tiah panoekhaih mah aicae loe zae net ih kami ah maw a oh o, to tih ai boeh loe zae tahmen ih kami, tito amtuengsak;)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sithaw mah Jesu Kri rang hoiah kaminawk mah tamquta hoi sak o ih hmuennawk lokcaek na niah loe, ka thuih ih kahoih tamthanglok hoiah ni lokcaek tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khenah, nang loe Judah kami, tiah kawk ih kami, kaalok ah amhaa kami, Sithaw amoek haih kami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />anih koehhaih panoek kami, kaalok mah patuk ih baktih toengah, kahoih kue hmuennawk panoek tawn kami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nangmah hoi nangmah to mikmaeng zaehoikung, khoving thungah kaom kaminawk aanghaih paekkung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kaalok thungah palunghahaih hoi loktang to oh pongah, kamthunawk loklam patuek kami hoi nawktanawk patukkung maeto ah ka oh o, tiah na poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah hoi nangmah ca amtuk ai ah maw, minawk kalah to ca na patuk? Paquk han ai ah kami khaeah lok na thuih e, nangmah loe na paquk maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kami maeto loe zu sava laep ah zaehaih sak han om ai, tiah na thuih, toe nang mah loe zu sava laep ah zaehaih na sak maw? Krang bokhaih to na panuet, toe tempul thung ih hmuennawk to na lomh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kaalok amoek haih kami mah, kaalok aekhaih hoiah Sithaw ih ahmin kasae na thuih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cabu thungah, nangcae pongah Gentelnawk salakah Sithaw ahmin kasae thuihhaih to oh boeh, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kaalok na pazui nahaeloe, tangyat hin aahhaih to atho oh: toe kaalok to na aek nahaeloe, tangyat hin na aah o haih loe tangyat hin aat ai baktiah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />To pongah, tangyat hin aat ai kami mah katoeng kaalok to pazui nahaeloe, anih to tangyat hin aat kami baktiah poek mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />To pongah taksa ah tangyat hin aat ai kami mah kaalok to pazui nahaeloe, Cabu tawn kami hoi tangyat hin aat kami ah na oh o cadoeh, kaalok pazui ai kami nang to lok na caek mak ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Taksa ah kamtueng, tasa bang kamtueng taksa ah tangyat hin aat kami loe, Judah kami na ai ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />toe a thung ih taksa ah tangyat hin aat kami to ni Judah kami tangtang: Cabu thung ih lok baktih toengah tangyat hin aat kami na ai ah, Muithla rang hoiah palungthin tangyat hin aat kami to ni, Judah kami tangtang; to baktih kami pakoehhaih loe kami khae hoiah angzo ai e, Sithaw khae hoiah angzoh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe Judah kami ah ohhaih timaw atho oh? To tih ai boeh loe tangyat hin aahhaih rang hoiah tih amekhaih maw oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amekhaih congca oh: lokpui koekah, Sithaw lok to nihcae khaeah pakuemsak pongah amekhaih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thoemto kaminawk mah tang o ai nahaeloe kawbangmaw om o tih? Katang ai nihcae khosakhaih mah Sithaw oep ohhaih to amrosak maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To tiah na ai ni: ue, Na thuih ih lok pongah toenghaih na hnu tih, lokcaekhaih na tongh naah na pazawk tih, tiah tarik ih oh baktih toengah, kami boih lok amlai o cadoeh, Sithaw loe loktang ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe aicae sethaih mah Sithaw toenghaih to amtuengsak nahaeloe, kawbangmaw a thuih o han? Aicae danpaek Sithaw loe toeng ai ah maw oh? (Kami baktiah ni lok ka thuih)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To tiah na ai ni: to tiah om nahaeloe Sithaw mah kawbangmaw long hae lokcaek tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lok kam laihaih hoiah loktang ah kaom Sithaw lensawkhaih to amtueng aep nahaeloe, tipongah kami zae maeto baktiah kai lokcaekhaih oh vop loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe tipongah kahoih hmuen tacawt thai hanah, kasae hmuen to sah o ngala si, tiah a thui o ai loe? (To tiah lok a thuih o ti, tiah thoemto kaminawk mah kaicae kasae ang thuih o). To tiah lokthui kami loe lokcaek han krak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe kawbangmaw oh boeh? Aicae loe nihcae pongah hoih kue maw? Hoih ai, hoih kue ai: Judahnawk doeh, Gentelnawk doeh, zaehaih thungah ni oh o boih, tiah kamnoekta ah kang thuih o boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />katoeng kami mi doeh om ai, om ai, maeto doeh om ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kathaih kop kami mi doeh om ai, Sithaw pakrong kami mi doeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nihcae loe loklam amkhraeng o boih boeh, nihcae loe tidoeh avang o ai boeh; kahoih hmuen sah kami mi doeh om ai, om ai, maeto doeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nihcae ih aqawnh loe taprong baktiah amongh moe, palai hoiah alinghaih lok to thuih o; nihcae ih pahni ah pahui kasoe to oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nihcae ih pakha loe tangoenghaih hoi kakhaa lok hoiah koi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />athii palong hanah karangah khok takanh o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a caeh o haih loklam ah amrohaih hoi patangkhanghaih to oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />monghaih loklam nihcae mah panoek o ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />nihcae mik ah Sithaw zithaih roe om ai, tiah Cabu thungah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kami boih mah lok apae ai ah oh moe, long kaminawk boih Sithaw hmaa ah lokcaek thai hanah, kaalok mah thuih ih hmuennawk boih loe kaalok thungah kaom kaminawk han ih ni thuih, tito vaihi a panoek o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kaalok mah zaehaih amtuengsak pongah, mi kawbaktih doeh kaalok pazuihaih rang hoiah Anih hmaa ah toenghaih hnu mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe kaalok hoi tahmaanawk ih lok mah hnukung ah oh boeh, Sithaw toenghaih loe kaalok pazuihaih hoiah om ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sithaw toenghaih loe, kaminawk boih hoi tanghaih tawn kaminawk boih hanah, Jesu Kri tanghaih rang hoiah ni oh; mi kawbaktih doeh lahhaih om ai boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kami boih zae o boeh moe, Sithaw lensawkhaih to hnu o thai ai boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />atho paek ai ah Kri Jesu mah akranghaih hoi a tahmenhaih rang hoiah ni toenghaih to a hnuk o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anih patangkhanghaih rang hoiah canghnii ah sak ih zaehaihnawk loe Sithaw mah tahmen boeh; a toenghaih to amtuengsak hanah, anih tanghaih rang hoiah, Angmah ih athii hoiah aicae zuengah tahmen hnikhaih angbawnhaih sak hanah, Sithaw mah to tiah sak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih loe katoeng kami ah oh, Jesu tanghaih tawn kaminawk toenghaih hnuksak hanah, a toenghaih to vaihi amtuengsak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe amoekhaih loe naa ah maw oh boeh? Amoekhaih loe anghmaat ving boeh. Kawbaktih kaalok pongah maw anghmaat ving? Toksakhaih hoiah maw anghmaat? Toksakhaih hoiah na ai ni; kaalok tanghaih rang hoiah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />To pongah, kami loe kaalok pazui pongah na ai, tanghaih rang hoiah ni toenghaih to hnuk, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih loe Judahnawk ih Sithaw khue maw? Gentelnawk ih Sithaw ah doeh om ai maw? Ue, Gentelnawk ih Sithaw ah doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sithaw loe maeto ah oh pongah, anih mah tangyat hin aat kami to tanghaih rang hoiah ni toenghaih to hnusak ueloe, tangyat hin aat ai kami doeh tanghaih rang hoiah ni toenghaih to hnusak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe tanghaih rang hoiah aicae mah kaalok a phraek o maw? A phrae o ai, ue, kaalok to ni a cak o sak aep.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe hae hmuen pongah aicae ampa Abraham mah taksa ah tih atho maw hnuk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham mah toksakhaih hoiah toenghaih hnu nahaeloe, anih amoek hanah hmuen maeto oh; toe Sithaw hmaa ah loe amoek thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cabu mah timaw thuih? Abraham mah Sithaw to tang pongah, to tanghaih to toenghaih ah tapom pae, tiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toksahkung mah a toksakhaih atho hnuk naah, tahmenhaih hoiah hnuk ih tangqum ah om ai, a hnuk han koi a tok sakhaih atho to ni a hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toe toksakhaih tawn ai kami loe Anih tanghaih tawn kami hanah toenghaih Paekkung to tang nahaeloe, a tanghaih rang hoiah katoeng kami ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To baktih toengah toksakhaih om ai ah, Sithaw mah paek ih toenghaih hnu kami ih tahamhoihaih to David mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sakpazaehaihnawk tahmen pae moe, zaehaihnawk khuk pae ah kaom kaminawk loe tahamhoih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Angraeng zae nethaih thung hoi loih kami loe tahamhoih, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham tanghaih loe toenghaih ah tapom pae, tiah a thuih o boeh. To tiah nahaeloe hae tahamhoihhaih loe tangyat hin aat kami han khue maw oh, tangyat hin aat ai kaminawk han doeh oh toeng maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kawbangah oh naah maw to tiah tapom pae? Tangyat hin a aah pacoengah maw? To tih ai boeh loe aat ai na ah? Aah pacoengah na ai, aat ai na ah ni toenghaih to hnuk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih loe tangyat hin aat o ai, toe to toenghaih to nihcae mah hnuk o toeng, tangcaanawk boih ih ampa ah a oh hanah, Abraham loe tangyat hin aat ai naah ni, tanghaih hoiah kaom toenghaih tacik tangyat hin aah angmathaih to hnuk boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham loe tangyat hin aat kaminawk ih ampa khue na ai ni, tangyat hin aat ai naah Abraham tanghaih khokkong pazui kaminawk boih ih ampa ah doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham loe long qawktoepkung ah om tih, tiah lokkamhaih to oh: to lokkamhaih loe Abraham mah kaalok pazui pongah na ai ni, tanghaih rang hoiah kaom toenghaih hoiah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaalok hoiah hing kaminawk mah qawk to toep o nahaeloe, tanghaih loe avanghaih tidoeh om mak ai ueloe, lokkamhaih doeh azom pui ah ni om tih boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaalok mah palungphuihaih to ohsak: kaalok om ai ahmuen ah loe zaehaih doeh om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham ih caanawk boih khaeah tahmenhaih rang hoiah kaom lokkamhaih to caaksak hanah, tanghaih loe lokpui koekah oh; lokkamhaih loe kaalok thungah kaom kaminawk han khue na ai ni, kaminawk boih ih ampa ah kaom, Abraham tanghaih tawn kaminawk boih khaeah doeh om tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abraham loe kadueh kaminawk hinghaih paekkung, kaom ai hmuennawk omsakkung hoi a tang ih Sithaw hmaa ah, (Nang loe acaeng kaminawk boih ih ampa ah kang sak boeh,) tiah tarik ih lok to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na caanawk loe to tiah om o nasoe, tiah anih khaeah thuih ih lok baktih toengah, Abraham mah kai loe acaengnawk ih ampa ah ka om tih, tiah oephaih to tawn ai, toe tanghaih rang hoiah oephaih a tawnh pongah ni, anih loe acaengnawk boih ih ampa ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham loe (saning cumvaito thuemtham oh boeh,) Sarah doeh caa kak, toe tanghaih thazok ai, kadueh baktiah kaom a takpum doeh poek khing ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih loe Sithaw lokkamhaih nuiah palunghaenghaih tawn ai, tanghaih bangah thacak moe, Sithaw to pakoeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />lokkamhaih sah Sithaw loe lokkam ih baktiah sak thaih, tiah kacaak tanghaih to a tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />To pongah, anih to kami katoeng ah tapom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih to katoeng kami ah tapom, tiah tarik ih lok loe anih han khue tarik ai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />aicae han doeh tarik ah oh toeng, aicae Angraeng Jesu duekhaih thung hoi pathawkkung Anih to a tang o nahaeloe, to tiah tanghaih to aicae toenghaih ah tapom pae toeng tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu loe aicae zaehaih pongah duek hanah angpaek moe, aicae toenghaih hnuk hanah duekhaih thung hoi angthawk let boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tanghaih rang hoiah katoeng kami ah a oh o boeh pongah, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah Sithaw hoi angdaehhaih a tawnh o boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anih a tang o haih rang hoiah hae a tahmenhaih ahmuen ah angdoet thaihaih to a hnuk o moe, Sithaw lensawkhaih oephaih hoiah ni anghoehaih a tawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To khue ai, raihaih mah pauep thaihaih to tacawtsak, tiah a panoek o pongah, raihaih a tongh o naah doeh anghoehaih a tawnh o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pauephaih mah tha khaang thaihaih to ohsak moe, khaang thaihaih mah oephaih to ohsak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />aicae khaeah paek ih, Kacai Muithla hoiah Sithaw amlunghaih to aicae palung thungah kraih boeh pongah, oephaih ah azathaih om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aicae loe thazok kami ah a oh o nathuem, atue mah phak naah, Kri loe Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk hanah duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kahoih kami hanah duek koeh kami maeto om khoe doeh om tih, toe katoeng kami hanah duek koeh kami loe kha parai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah loe aicae khaeah angmah ih amlunghaih to amtuengsak boeh; kazae kami ah a oh o li naah, Kri aicae hanah duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aicae loe vaihi angmah ih athii rang hoiah katoeng kami ah a oh o boeh, Anih rang hoiah Sithaw palungphuihaih thung hoi pahlonghaih a hnu o aep vop tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sithaw ih misa ah a oh o li naah, a Capa duekhaih rang hoiah Sithaw hoi angdaehaih to sah let nahaeloe, a hinghaih angpaekhaih rang hoiah angdaehhaih sak pacoengah cae loe, kawkruk maw pahlonghaih to a hnu o aep vop tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hae khue ai, aicae loe aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah Sithaw ah anghoehaih a tawnh o moe, Anih rang hoiah vaihi Sithaw hoi angdaehhaih a hnuk o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pongah, kami maeto rang hoiah long ah duekhaih to akun moe, zaehaih rang hoiah duekhaih to oh; kami boih zae pongah, duekhaih mah kami boih to cen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />(Kaalok ohhaih atue karoek to long ah zaehaih to oh: toe kaalok om ai naah loe zaehaih to amtueng ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toe zaehaih mah Adam hoi Mosi karoek to uk, Adam baktiah zaehaih sah ai kaminawk doeh a uk; Adam loe angzo han koi kami to hnuksakhaih ih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe zae sakhaih hoi azom ah paek ih tangqum loe anghmong ai. Kami maeto mah zae pongah paroeai kaminawk dueh o nahaeloe, kami maeto tahmenhaih rang hoiah kaom tangqum, Jesu Kri rang hoiah cae loe kawkruk maw kaminawk khaeah Sithaw tahmenhaih to om aep tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangqum loe kazae kami maeto hoiah angzo hmuen hoiah anghmong ai: kami maeto zae pongah lokcaekhaih to oh moe, danpaekhaih to oh, toe azom ah paek ih tangqum mah loe pop parai zaehaih tawn cadoeh toenghaih to hnuksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kami maeto zaehaih pongah, to kami maeto rang hoiah duekhaih mah uk nahaeloe, paroeai tahmenhaih hoi toenghaih tangqum hnu kaminawk mah cae loe, kawkruk maw Jesu Kri maeto rang hoiah hing o ueloe, uk o aep tih.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To pongah kami maeto mah zae pongah kami boih to lokcaek ah oh moe, danpaek baktih toengah, azom ah paek ih kami maeto toenghaih rang hoiah kami boih hing hanah, toenghaih to hnu tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kami maeto mah lok tahngai ai pongah paroeai kaminawk kazae caa ah oh o baktih toengah, kami maeto mah lok tahngaihaih rang hoiah paroeai kaminawk mah toenghaih to hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zae pung han ih ni kaalok to oh. Toe zae pophaih ahmuen ah, tahmenhaih doeh pop aep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zaehaih mah duekhaih to uk baktih toengah, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah dungzan hinghaih hnuk hanah, toenghaih rang hoiah tahmenhaih mah uk toeng tih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawbangmaw a tih o han? Tahmenhaih pop aep hanah zaehaih a sak o poe han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sah o mak ai. Zaehaih thungah a duek o boeh loe, kawbangmaw to zaehaih thungah a hing o let thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah tuinuem kaminawk boih loe Anih duekhaih ah ni tuinuem o, tito na panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Duekhaih ah tuinuem rang hoiah aicae loe anih hoi nawnto aphum boeh: Kri loe Ampa lensawkhaih hoiah duekhaih thung hoi angthawk let baktih toengah, aicae doeh kangtha hinghaih loklam ah a caeh o toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih hoi nawnto a duek o boeh nahaeloe, Anih angthawk lethaih ah doeh Anih hoi nawnto angthawk o let tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zaehaih takpum to amrosak ving moe, vaihi hoi kamtong zaehaih tamna ah a oh o han ai ah, aicae ih kami kangquem loe Anih hoi nawnto thinglam pongah takhing boeh, tiah a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To pongah kadueh kami loe zaehaih thung hoiah loih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaihi Kri hoi nawnto a duek o nahaeloe, Anih hoi nawnto a hing o tih, tiah tanghaih a tawnh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kri loe duekhaih thung hoi angthawk let boeh pongah, dueh let mak ai boeh; duekhaih mah Anih to uk mak ai boeh, tiah a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih duek naah, zaehaih pongah vaito ni a duek: toe Anih hing naah loe Sithaw ah ni a hing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To baktih toengah nangcae doeh zaehaih thungah ka duek o, toe aicae Angraeng Kri Jesu rang hoiah Sithaw ah ka hing o boeh, tiah poek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pongah taksa koehhaih pazui han ai ah, kadueh thaih na taksa to zaehaih mah uk hma lai nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na takpum tanghangnawk to katoeng ai hmuen sak hanah patoh o hmah: toe duekhaih thung hoi kangthawk, hinghaih tawn kaminawk baktiah, katoeng hmuen sak hanah na takpum tanghangnawk to Sithaw khaeah angpaek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangcae loe kaalok thungah na om o ai, tahmenhaih thungah ni na oh o boeh, to pongah zaehaih mah nangcae uk han om ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawbangah maw oh boeh? Kaalok thungah a om o ai, tahmenhaih thungah ni a oh o boeh, to pongah zaehaih a sak o han vop maw? A sah o mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Duekhaih omsak zaehaih khaeah maw, to tih ai boeh loe toenghaih omsak lok tahngaihaih khaeah misong baktiah a lok tahngaih pae han nang paek o naah, lok na tahngaih pae kami ih tamna ah ni na oh o, tito na panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangcae loe zae tamna ah na oh o, toe nangcae loihsakkung patukhaih lok to palung tang hoi na tang o pongah, Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lok thuih han ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangcae loe zaehaih thung hoi loih boeh moe, toenghaih tamna ah na oh o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Taksa ah tha na zok o pongah, kami baktiah ni lok kang thuih o: zaehaih sak aep hanah na takpum tanghangnawk to ciimcai ai zaehaih misong ah nang paek o baktih toengah, ciimcai hanah vaihi na takpum tanghangnawk to toenghaih misong ah angpaek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangcae zaehaih misong ah na oh o naah, toenghaih hoiah na loih o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vaihi na sak o ih azat kaom hmuennawk pongah nangcae mah tih hoihhaih atho maw na hnuk o? To baktih hmuennawk loe duekhaih hoiah ni boeng o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe zaehaih thung hoi na loih o boeh moe, Sithaw ih tamna ah na oh o boeh, ciimcaihaih thingthai to na hnuk o, hnukkhuem ah, dungzan hinghaih to na hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zaehaih tho loe duekhaih ih ni; toe Sithaw tangqum loe aicae Angraeng Kri Jesu rang hoiah dungzan hinghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, (kaalok panoek kaminawk khaeah ni lok ka thuih,) kami hing nathung khue ni kaalok mah kami to uk, tito na panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuih rumram ah, sava tawn nongpata loe sava hing nathung daan lok mah taoengh; toe sava to dueh nahaeloe sava ih daan lok thung hoiah a loih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To pongah a sava hing nathung anih mah kalah nongpa hoi nawnto om nahaeloe, anih loe daan ai ah sava nuiah zaehaih sah kami, tiah thui o tih: toe sava to dueh boeh nahaeloe, anih mah kalah nongpa khaeah sava sah cadoeh, to daan thung hoiah a loih boeh pongah, anih loe daan lok aek kami hoi zaehaih sah kami ah om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To pongah, nawkamyanawk, kalah kami hoi imthong na krak o moe, duekhaih thung hoi angthawk Anih khaeah Sithaw ah thingthai na thaih o thai hanah, nangcae doeh Kri takpum rang hoiah kaalok thungah na duek o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aicae taksa ah a oh o naah, kaalok rang hoiah zae sak koehhaih palungthin mah, duekhaih thingthai athaih hanah, zaehaih mah aicae takpum thungah toksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toe aicae loe vaihi kangquem Ca thungah a om o ai boeh, lokpaek kangtha Muithla ah tok a sak o thai hanah, duek hanah aicae qui hoi taoeng, kaalok thung hoiah a loih o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe kawbangmaw a tih o han boeh? Kaalok ah zaehaih oh maw? Zaehaih om ai. Toe kaalok rang hoiah ni, zaehaih to ka panoek: Kaalok mah khit hmah, tiah thui ai nahaeloe, khithaih loe timaw, tito ka panoek mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe zaehaih mah kaalok nuiah atue kahoih to lak moe, ka nuiah congca khithaih hmuennawk to ohsak. Kaalok om ai ah loe zaehaih to duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Canghniah kai loe kaalok ai ah ka hing: toe kaalok angzoh naah, zaehaih angphong pongah, kai loe ka duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinghaih paek han kaom kaalok mah, duekhaih ohsak, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zaehaih mah kaalok nuiah atue kahoih to lak moe, kai to ang ling; to kaalok mah kai ang hum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pongah, kaalok loe ciimcai, lokpaekhaih doeh ciimcai, toeng moe hoih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe kahoih hmuen loe kai han duekhaih ah oh maw? Om ai. Toe zae to zae baktiah amtueng thaih moe, kaalok rang hoiah zae to zaesak aep hanah, kahoih hmuen patohhaih rang hoiah ka nuiah duekhaih to ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaalok loe Muithla ih hmuen ni, tito a panoek o: toe taksa ah ka oh pongah, zae thungah zawh ih kami ah ka oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sak ih hmuen to ka koeh ai: ka sak koeh ih hmuen to ka sah ai; ka hnukma ih hmuen to ka sak lat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To tiah ka sak koeh ai ih hmuen to ka sak naah, kaalok loe toeng, tiah ka tapom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toe vaihi kahoih ai hmuen sah kami loe kai na ai boeh ni, kai thungah kaom zae mah ni sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kai (ka taksa thungah,) thungah kahoih hmuen roe om ai, tito ka panoek: sak han ka koeh, toe kahoih hmuen sakhaih loklam to ka hnu ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sak ka koeh ih kahoih hmuen to ka sah ai: toe sak ka koeh ai ih kahoih ai hmuen to ni ka sak lat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sak koeh ai ih hmuen to vaihi ka sak vop nahaeloe, kai mah sak ih na ai boeh ni, kai thungah kaom zae mah ni sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahoih hmuen sak ka koeh naah, kahoih ai hmuen kai khaeah oh, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kai thungah kaom kami mah loe Sithaw ih kaalok to koeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />toe ka takpum ah kaom kalah kaalok mah, ka poekhaih thungah kaom kaalok to aek, to tiah ka takpum ah kaom hmuennawk mah, zae sakhaih kaalok ih misong ah ang laemh haih, tito ka hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kai loe amtang amlai kami ah ni ka oh boeh! hae duekhaih takpum thung hoiah mi mah maw na loisak tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah, Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lok ka thuih! to pongah ka poekhaih hoiah loe Sithaw ih kaalok baktiah tok ka sak, toe ka taksa hoiah loe zae sakhaih kaalok baktiah ni ka sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah vaihi Kri Jesu ah kaom, taksa baktiah kacaeh ai, Muithla baktiah kacaeh kaminawk hanah, lokcaekhaih om ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah Muithla hinghaih lok mah zae duekhaih lok thung hoiah ang loisak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taksa rang hoiah thazok moe, kaalok mah toksah thai ai naah, zae loihsak hanah, Sithaw mah zae taksa tawn kami baktiah a Capa to patoeh, Anih mah zae taksa to danpaek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />taksa koehhaih baktiah kacaeh ai, Muithla koehhaih baktiah caeh kami loe, kaalok mah thuih ih toenghaih to aicae khaeah koepsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Taksa koehhaih baktiah khosah kaminawk loe taksa koehhaih hmuennawk to poek o; toe Muithla koehhaih baktiah khosah kaminawk loe Muithla koehhaih hmuennawk to poek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Taksa poekhaih palung loe duekhaih ih ni; toe Muithla poekhaih palung loe hinghaih hoi monghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tipongah tih nahaeloe taksa poekhaih palung loe Sithaw hoi misa ah oh: Sithaw lok ah angpaek ai khue na ai ah, angpaek doeh angpaek thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pongah, taksa ah kaom kaminawk loe Sithaw ih palung tongh o thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toe Sithaw ih Muithla nangcae thungah om nahaeloe, nangcae loe taksa ah na om o ai, Muithla ah ni na oh o. Mi kawbaktih doeh Kri Muithla tawn ai kami loe, Kri ih kami na ai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toe nangcae thungah Kri to om nahaeloe, zae pongah nangcae ih takpum dueh cadoeh, toenghaih pongah Muithla loe hinghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toe duekhaih hoi Jesu Pathawkkung ih Muithla to nangcae thungah om nahaeloe, nangcae thungah kaom Anih ih Muithla rang hoiah duekhaih thung hoi Kri Pathawkkung mah, kadueh thaih nangcae ih takpum to pathawk toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pongah nawkamyanawk, aicae loe taksa ah om ai, taksa koehhaih baktiah a hing o han ai ah, laiba a tawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Taksa koehhaih baktiah na hing o nahaeloe, na dueh o tih: toe Muithla rang hoiah taksa mah sak ih zaehaihnawk to na hum o nahaeloe, na hing o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sithaw Muithla mah zaeh ih kaminawk boih loe, Sithaw caa ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangcae loe zit kaom tamna ah oh lethaih palung to na hak o ai; Abba, Pa, tiah kawk thaihaih a caa ah angcoenghaih Muihtla ni na hak o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aicae loe Sithaw ih caa ah a oh o, tito aicae ih muithla hoi nawnto Sithaw angmah ih Muithla mah hnukung ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih ih caa ah a oh o nahaeloe, qawktoepkung, Sithaw ih qawktoep kami ah a om o ueloe, Kri hoi nawnto qawktoepkung ah a om o tih; anih hoi nawnto patang a khang o nahaeloe, aicae doeh a lensawkhaih ah om o toeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaihi thuem karai tonghaihnawk loe aicae khaeah amtueng han koi lensawkhaih hoi patah naah tidoeh na ai ni, tiah ka poek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sithaw caanawk amtuenghaih to a sak ih hmuenanwk boih mah paroeai oephaih hoiah zing o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sak ih hmuen to doeh amrohaih misong thung hoiah loihsak moe, kalensawk Sithaw caanawk loihhaih thungah akun toeng han oh pongah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a sak ih hmuen loe tidoeh avang ai ah oh sut, toe angmakoeh ah to tiah om ai, oephaih rang hoiah ni Anih mah to tiah ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sak ih hmuennawk boih loe vaihi khoek to nawkta oh tom nathuem ih zok kana baktiah pacip pa-aahaih hoiah a hang o, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nihcae khue ai, Muithla thingthai tangsuek ah kaom aicae doeh, a caa ah ohhaih hoi aicae taksa loih han akranghaih to a oep o pongah, a zing o naah aimacae ih palung thung hoiah a hangh o toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aicae loe to oephaih hoiah ni pahlong ah oh: toe hnukhaih loe oephaih ah om ai: kami maeto mah a hnuk tangcae hmuen to oep khing vop tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toe a hnu o ai ih hmuen to a oep o nahaeloe, to hmuen to palungsawkhaih hoiah zing han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />To baktih toengah aicae thazok naah Muithla mah ang bomh: aicae mah lawk a thuih o han oh, lawkthuih han koi to a panoek o ai: toe lok hoi thui laek ai karoek to Muithla mah roe mah ahamhaih hoiah aicae taham ah lawk ang thuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Palungthin Pakrongkung mah loe Muithla poekhaih palung to panoek, tipongah tih nahaeloe Sithaw koehhaih baktih toengah Anih mah kaciim kaminawk hanah lawkthuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anih mah Sithaw palung kaminawk hoi a timhaih baktiah kawk ih kaminawk hanah khosak hoihaih hmuennawk a sak pae boih, tito a panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anih loe pop parai nawkamyanawk thungah calu koekah oh moe, a Capa hoi kanghmong ah ohsak hanah, Angmah panoek coek ih kami to a thuih coek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />To tiah Angmah panoek coek ih kaminawk to ni Anih mah doeh kawk: a kawk ih kaminawk to a toengsak: a toengsak ih kaminawk to a pakoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe hae hmuennawk hae kawbangmaw a thuih o han? Aicae bangah Sithaw om nahaeloe, mi mah maw aicae hae tuh thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A Capa mataeng doeh paquem ai ah, aicae boih han Paekkung loe, hmuennawk boih aicae han azom ah paek ai ah om tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toenghaih omsakkung loe Sithaw ni, to pongah Sithaw mah qoih ih kaminawk to mi mah maw zae net thai tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lokcaek kami loe mi aa? Kri loe duek, toe duekhaih thung hoi angthawk let boeh, Anih loe Sithaw bantang bangah anghnut moe, aicae taham ah lawkthuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kri amlunghaih hoiah mi mah maw aicae tapraek thai tih? Amtanghaih, to tih ai boeh loe patangkhanghaih, to tih ai boeh loe pacaekthlaekhaih, to tih ai boeh loe takaang thohhaih, to tih ai boeh loe bangkrai ah ohhaih, to tih ai boeh loe zit kathok raihaih hoi sumsennawk mah tapraek thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangcae pongah kaicae loe athun qui duekhaih ka tongh o; kaicae loe boh han suek ih tuu baktiah a poek o, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />To tiah na ai ni, hae hmuennawk boih Palungkung, Anih rang hoiah aicae loe pazawk kaminawk pong kapop ah a pazawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kai loe duekhaih mah doeh, hinghaih mah doeh, van kaminawk mah doeh, van ukkungnawk mah doeh, thacakhaih mah doeh, vaihiah kaom hmuen mah doeh, hmabang kaom han koi hmuennawk mah doeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />kasang mah doeh, kahnaem mah doeh, kawbaktih sak ih hmuen mah doeh, aicae Angraeng Kri Jesu ah kaom, Sithaw amlunghaih thung hoiah tapraek thai mak ai, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kri ah loktang ni ka thuih, lok kam lai ai, Kacai Muithla ah kasae kahoih panoekhaih palungthin mah doeh kai hnukung ah oh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />palung ka set moe, boeng thai ai poek angphohaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taksa ah kaimah ih acaengnawk hoi nawkamyanawk hanah, kaimah roe hae Kri khae hoiah tangoenghaih tongh han khoek to ka koeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nihcae loe Israel kami ah oh o moe, pacah ih caa ah ohhaih, lensawkhaih, lokmaihaih, kaalok paekhaih, Sithaw toksakhaih hoi lokkamhaih hnu kami ah oh o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nihcae loe aicae ampa ah oh o, taksa ah nihcae thung hoiah ni Kri to angzoh, Anih loe hmuennawk boih ukkung ah oh moe, dungzan tahamhoihaih Sithaw ah oh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sithaw lok loe atho om ai, tiah thuih koehhaih ih na ai ni. Israel hoi tacawt kaminawk loe Israel kami boih na ai ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham ih atii ah oh o pongah, nihcae loe caa ah om o boih ai: toe Isak khae hoiah ni nang ih atii, tiah kawk o tih, tiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pongah, taksa ah kaom caanawk loe Sithaw ih caa na ai ni: lokkamhaih hoiah kaom caanawk to ni atii, tiah kroek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaihi tue thuem phak naah, kang zoh han, to naah Sarah mah capa maeto sah tih, tiah lokkamhaih to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hae khue ai; Rebekah doeh kami maeto, aicae ampa Isak ih caa to pom naah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Sithaw mah qoih ih baktih toengah oh hanah, Sithaw khokkhanhaih loe toksakhaih hoiah om ai, kawkkung Anih koehhaih baktiah ni om tih, tiah a caa hnik tapen ai vop moe, a caa hnik mah kasae hmuen maw, to tih ai boeh loe kahoih hmuen maw sakhaih om ai naah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nongpata khaeah, Kacoeh mah kanawk ih tok to sah pae tih, tiah a thuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jakob to ka palung, Isau loe ka hnukma, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe kawbangmaw a tih o han boeh? Sithaw loe toeng ai, tiah a thuih o han maw? A thui o mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sithaw mah Mosi khaeah, Palungnat han koeh ih kami nuiah palung ka nat moe, palung han koeh ih kami to ka palung han, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />To pongah kami mah koeh pongah na ai, toksah kami pongah doeh na ai, palungnathaih amtuengsak Sithaw pongah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cabu mah Faro khaeah, Ka timhaih baktiah nang khaeah Ka thacakhaih kam tuengsak moe, Ka hmin long pum ah taphong han ih ni, kang qoengsak, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To pongah, Anih loe a koeh ih kami nuiah palungnathaih tawnh moe, a koeh ih kami to palung thahsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe Anih koehhaih to mi mah maw pakaa thai ai to mah, tipongah Anih mah kami zaehaih to pakrong loe? tiah na thuih o han maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thui o mak ai, toe, Aw kami, Sithaw lok aek nang loe mi aa? A sak ih hmuen mah Sahkung khaeah, Tipongah hae tiah nang sak loe, tiah naa thai tih maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Laom sah kami loe amlai long tawnkung ah oh pongah, kanghmong amlai long hoiah na ai maw kahoih laom hoi kasae laom to a sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sithaw mah angmah ih palungphuihaih to amtuengsak moe, a sakthaihaih panoeksak han koeh pongah, paro hanah sak ih palungphuihaih kaomsak laomnawk nuiah palungsawkhaih tawn nahaeloe timaw thuih han oh vop,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />anih mah kating ai a lensawkhaih to pakoeh han sak coek ih, tahmenhaih laomnawk nuiah amtuengsak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judahnawk khae khue ai, Gentelnawk hoi anih mah kawk ih aicae khaeah doeh amtuengsak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hosea Cabu thungah, Kai ih kami ah kaom ai kaminawk to Kai ih kami, tiah Ka kawk han; palung ai ih kami to kang palung, tiah Ka naa han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nihcae khaeah, Nangcae loe Kai ih kami na ai ni, tiah thuih ih ahmuen ah kaom kaminawk to kahing Sithaw ih capanawk, tiah kawk tih, tiah thuih ih lok to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tahmaa Isaiah mah doeh Israel kawng pongah, Israel caanawk loe tuipui ih savuet zetto pop o langlacadoeh, kanghmat kaminawk ni pahlong ah om o tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />anih mah toenghaih hoiah toksak pacoeng hanah, lok takroek tih; Angraeng mah long ah sak han atimhaih to sah palang tih, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tahmaa Isaiah mah loe, Sabaoth Angraeng mah aicae ih atii paquem ai nahaeloe, aicae loe Sodom baktiah a om o ueloe, Gomorrah hoiah anghmong tih boeh, tiah thuih coek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe kawbangmaw a tih o han boeh? Toenghaih pazui ai Gentelnawk loe, tanghaih rang hoiah kaom, toenghaih to hnuk o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toe kaalok rang hoiah kaom toenghaih pazui, Israelnawk loe, kaalok rang hoiah kaom toenghaih to hnu o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tipongah hnu o ai loe? Nihcae loe amthaekhaih thlung pongah amtimh o pongah, tanghaih hoiah pakrong o ai, kaalok mah thuih ih baktih toengah toksakhaih rang hoiah pakrong o lat pongah ni hnu o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cabu thungah, Khenah, Zion ah amthaekhaih thlung hoi amtimhaih thlung to ka suek: mi kawbaktih doeh Anih tang kami loe azathaih tongh mak ai, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, Israelnawk pahlonghaih hnuk hanah, palung thungah koehhaih oh pongah, Sithaw khaeah lawk ka thuih pae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nihcae loe Sithaw azom o, tiah ka hnuk, toe panoekhaih bangah khodai o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nihcae loe Sithaw toenghaih to pahnawt o moe, Sithaw toenghaih ah amha o ai ah, angmacae toenghaih to sak hanah pakrong o lat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tang kaminawk boih toenghaih hnuk thai hanah, Kri loe kaalok boenghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi mah, To hmuennawk sah pazui kami loe to hmuennawk sak pazuihaih rang hoiah hing tih, tiah kaalok rang hoiah kaom toenghaih kawng to tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toe tanghaih rang hoiah kaom toenghaih mah loe, (Kri to ranui bang hoiah hoih tathuk hanah,) Mi maw van ah daw tahang tih? tiah na palung thung hoiah thui hmah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />to tih ai boeh loe, (Duekhaih thung hoi Kri pathawk let hanah,) Mi maw kathuk thungah angthum tathuk tih? tiah thui hmah, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawbangah maw a thuih tih nahaeloe, Lok loe na taengah oh, na pakha hoi na palung thungah oh: to lok loe aicae mah a thuih o ih, tanghaih lok to ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu loe Angraeng ni, tiah pakha hoi na taphong moe, Sithaw mah Anih to duekhaih thung hoiah pathawk let boeh, tiah palung thung hoi na tang nahaeloe, pahlong ah na om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Palung thung hoi tang naah toenghaih to oh; pakha hoi taphong naah pahlonghaih to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh Anih tang kami loe azathaih tongh mak ai, tiah Cabu mah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih kawk kaminawk boih nuiah paawt ai ah kapaek Angraeng maeto khue ni oh, to pongah Judah hoi Grik lahhaih to om ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh Angraeng hmin kawk kami loe pahlong ah om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />To tiah nahaeloe tanghaih tawn ai kaminawk mah anih to kawbangmaw kawk o tih? Nihcae mah thaihaih tawn ai ah kawbangmaw Anih to tang o tih? Lok thui kami om ai ah kawbangmaw nihcae mah thaih o tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nihcae to patoeh ai ah kawbangmaw nihcae mah thui o tih? Angdaehhaih kahoih tamthanglok thui kami hoi khosak kahoih anghoehaih tamthang sin kaminawk ih khok loe kawkrukmaw kranghoih! tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toe nihcae boih mah kahoih tamthanglok to tang o ai. Tahmaa Isaiah mah, Angraeng, ka thuih o ih lok tang kami oh maw? tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanghaih loe thaihhaih hoiah angzoh, thaihhaih loe Sithaw lok hoiah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toe nihcae loe thaih o ai maw? A thaih o boeh, Nihcae ih lok loe long pum ah phak boeh, a thuih o ih loknawk doeh long boenghaih khoek to phak boeh, tiah ka thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hae tiah ka thuih, Israel kaminawk loe panoek o ai maw? Hmaloe koekah Mosi mah, Acaeng kami ah kaom ai kaminawk to kang utsak moe, amthu kaminawk hoiah palung kang phui o sak han, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahmaa Isaiah mah, Kai pakrong ai kaminawk mah Kai ang hnuk o; Kai khaeah hni ai kaminawk khaeah Kam tueng pae, tiah misa hoihhaih hoiah lokthuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toe Israel kaminawk khaeah loe anih mah, Lok tahngai ai kaminawk hoi lokaek kaminawk khaeah, athun qui ban ka payangh, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe, Sithaw mah angmah ih kaminawk to pahnawt sut boeh maw? Pahnawt sut ai, tiah ka thuih. Kai doeh Israel acaeng maeto ah ka oh, Abraham ih atii ah ka oh moe, Benzamin acaeng ah ni ka oh toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sithaw loe angmah panoek coek ih angmah ih kaminawk to pahnawt sut ai. Elijah mah, Cabu thungah Israel kaminawk koeh ai amtuengsak hanah Sithaw khaeah khawbangmaw lawk a thuih, tito na panoek o ai maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih mah, Angraeng, nang ih tahmaanawk to a hum o, nang bokhaih imnawk doeh a phraek o; kaimah bueng ni anghmat boeh, kai doeh hum han ang pakrong o, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah anih khaeah kawbangmaw lok pathim pae? Sakcop ih krang Baal hmaa ah khokkhu cangkrawn ai kaimah hanah pahoe ih kami sang sarihto oh o vop, tiah a naa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />To baktih toengah vaihi doeh a tahmenhaih rang hoiah qoih ih anghmat kami maeto oh vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahmenhaih rang hoiah om nahaeloe, toksakhaih rang hoiah om mak ai boeh: to tih ai nahaeloe tahmenhaih loe tahmenhaih ah om mak ai. Toe toksakhaih rang hoiah ni om nahaeloe, tahmenhaih hoiah om mak ai boeh: to tih ai nahaeloe toksakhaih loe toksakhaih ah om mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe kawbangmaw oh boeh? Pakrong ih hmuen to Israel mah hnu ai: qoih ih kami mah ni hnuk, kalah kaminawk loe mikmaeng o,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Sithaw mah iih angmuethaih muithla, hnuk han ai ih mik, thaih han ai ih naa to nihcae khaeah paek;) tiah tarik ih Cabu loe vaihni ah akoep boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David mah doeh, Nihcae ih caboi loe nihcae hanah, dongh, thaang, amthaekhaih hoi a sak o ih baktiah pathok let ih hmuen ah om nasoe:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nihcae mah hnuk o thaih han ai ah, mik amtueng pae hmah nasoe loe, kaengkuu o poe nasoe, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To tih nahaeloe, nihcae loe angthawk thai ai khoek to amthaek o boeh maw? tiah ka thuih, To tiah om ai: nihcae utsak hanah, nihcae amtimh o pongah ni Gentelnawk khaeah pahlonghaih to phak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaihi nihcae amtimhaih loe long angraenghaih ah oh lat boeh, nihcae mah pathlong ih hmuen to Gentelnawk angraenghaih ah om nahaeloe, nihcae akoephaih mah cae loe nazetto maw angraenghaih omsak aep tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai loe Gentelnawk hanah patoeh ih kami ah ka oh baktih toengah, nangcae Gentelnawk khaeah lok kang thuih o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kawbangah doeh taksa ah kaimah ih kaminawk to utsak moe, nihcae thung ih thoemto kaminawk ka pahlong thai hanah, ka sak ih tok to kam oek haih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nihcae pahnawt suthaih to long angdaeh lethaih ah om nahaeloe, nihcae talawkhaih mah cae loe, duekhaih thung hoi kahing baktiah na ai maw om tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naep hmaloe ih takaw to ciim nahaeloe, takaw loe ciim boih; tangzun to ciim nahaeloe, tanghangnawk doeh ciim o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangcae loe, taw ih Olive thing ah na oh o, thoemto tanghangnawk loe angkhaeh o ving boeh pongah, nangcae to Olive thing nuiah pacong ah oh, to tiah Olive thing ih tangzun hoi athawk nawnto caak angbom kami ah na oh o nahaeloe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />angkhaek tanghangnawk to amoek o thuih hmah. Nam oek o thuih nahaeloe, nangcae mah tangzun to tha na paek o ai, tangzun mah ni nangcae han tha ang paek o, tito panoek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai pacong hanah ni, to tanghangnawk to khaeh ving, tiah na poek doeh om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na poekhaih loe hoih; tang ai pongah nihcae loe angkhaeh o, nangcae loe tanghaih hoiah nang doet o. Toe poeksang o hmah, zithaih palungthin to tawn oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tanghang tangtangnawk mataeng doeh Sithaw mah paquem ai nahaeloe, nangcae doeh paquem mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />To pongah Sithaw hoihhaih hoi kanung parai danpaekhaih to poek oh: amtimh kaminawk nuiah, kanung parai danpaekhaih to oh; toe nangcae khaeah loe hoihaih to oh, anih hoihhaih thungah na oh o poe nahaeloe, nangcae khaeah hoihhaih to om poe tih, to tih ai nahaeloe nangcae doeh pakhruh ving tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nihcae doeh tanghaih tawn o nahaeloe, to akung ah pacong toeng tih: Sithaw mah nihcae to akung ah pacong let thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangcae loe taw ih olive thing to pakhruk moe, tling ih kahoih olive thing pongah pacong ih tanghang ah na oh o nahaeloe, angmacae ih Olive thing tangtang nuiah cae loe hae tanghang tangtangnawk hae, kawkruk maw pacong thai aep tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, Gentelnawk akoephaih ni pha ai karoek to thoemto Israelnawk loe palung maeng o, tiah thuih ih hae lok tamqu hae panoek ai ah ohsak han kang koeh o haih ai, to tih ai nahaeloe nangmacae aling hanah nangmacae mikhnuk ah palungha kami ah na om o moeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israelnawk boih pahlong ah om o tih: loisakkung loe Zion hoiah angzo ueloe, Jakob acaeng Sithaw panoek ai ah khosakhaih to anghmasak tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nihcae zaehaihnawk to ka takhoe pae han, hae loe nihcae khaeah ka sak ih lokmaihaih ah oh, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah tamthanglok hoih phak thai hanah, Israelnawk loe Sithaw ih misa ah oh o: toe qoihhaih bangah loe, ampanawk rang hoiah nihcae loe Sithaw mah palung ih kami ah oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sithaw loe a paek ih tangqum hoi a kawk ih kaminawk nuiah poek amkhraihaih tawn ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangcae doeh canghniah loe Sithaw ih lok na tahngai o ai, toe nihcae mah lok tahngai o ai pongah ni nangcae mah vaihi palungnathaih to na hnuk o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nangcae khaeah amtuengsak ih palungnathaih rang hoiah nihcae mah palungnathaih hnuk o toeng hanah, nihcae loe vaihi lok tahngai o ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sithaw mah kami boih nuiah palungnathaih tawnh thai hanah, kami boih lok tahngai ai ah ohsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aw, Sithaw palunghahaih hoi panoekhaih loe kawkruk maw kawk moe len! A lokcaekhaih loe mi mah doeh panoek thai ai, a caehhaih loklamnawk to pakrong khing caedoeh hnu thai ai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Angraeng poekhaih panoek mi maw kaom? To tih ai boeh loe mi maw Anih han poekhaih kahoih paekkung ah kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />To tih ai boeh loe Anih mah pathok let hanah mi mah maw Anih hanah hmuen paek vaih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hmuennawk boih loe Anih ih ni, Anih rang hoiah a oh o moe, Anih han ih ni a oh o; lensawkhaih loe Angmah khaeah dungzan ah om poe nasoe! Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah nawkamyanawk, Sithaw palungnathaih rang hoiah, ciimcai moe, Sithaw mah tapom ih hmuen ah kaom, na takpum to kahing hmuen tathlanghaih ah nang paek o hanah, kang pacae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangcae loe hae long kami ah angcoeng o hmah: poek angthahaih hoiah amkhrai oh, to tiah ni kahoih hmuen, koeh koi kaom, kakoep Sithaw koehhaih to na panoek o thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangcae salakah kaom mi kawbaktih mah doeh, angmah hoi angmah to poek han koi hmuen pong kamthlai ah poek han om ai, toe Sithaw mah kami maeto boih hanah kating tawk ah paek ih tanghaih baktih toengah ni nangmah hoi nangmah to poek han oh, tiah kai khaeah paek ih tahmenhaih rang hoiah nangcae boih khaeah lok kang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Takpum maeto pongah tanghang oh mangh, tanghangnawk loe maeto hoi maeto toksakhaih anghmong boih ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />to tiah aicae loe, a pop o parai, toe Kri ah loe takpum maeto ni, aicae loe maeto hoi maeto kangpeh tanghang ah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aicae khae paek ih tahmenhaih baktih toengah paek ih kalah kalah tangqum to a tawnh o, lok taphonghaih a tawnh o nahaeloe, tanghaih a tawn o ih baktih toengah lok to taphong o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To tih ai boeh loe toksakhaih maw a tawnh o nahaeloe, tok to sah o si, patuk kami mah loe, patukhaih tok to sah nasoe;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kami thapaekhaih tawn kami loe, thapaekhaih tok to sah nasoe: paekthaihaih tawn kami loe, paek koehhaih palung hoiah paek nasoe, uk thaihaih tawn kami loe, palung angpaekhaih hoiah uk nasoe; kami nuiah palungnathaih tawn kami loe, poeknawmhaih hoiah palung nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amlunghaih ah angsakhaih om hmah nasoe. Kahoih ai hmuen to panuet oh loe, kahoih hmuen to kacakah patawn oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maeto hoi maeto nawkamya amlunghaih hoiah amlung oh; maeto hoi maeto khingyahaih ang paek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toksak paqak o hmah; tha pathok oh loe, Angraeng tok to sah oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />oephaih tawn oh loe anghoe oh; raihaih tongh naah pauephaih palung to tawn oh loe, boeng ai ah lawkthui oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kavawt kaciim kaminawk hanah hmuen to paek oh, angvinnawk to kahoihah khenzawn oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangcae pacaekthlaek kaminawk to tahamhoihhaih paek oh, tangoeng o thuih hmah, tahamhoihaih paek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anghoe kaminawk hoi nawnto anghoe oh, palungsae kaminawk hoi nawnto palungsae oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maeto hoi maeto poek anghmong oh. Long hmuennawk to amoek o haih hmah, poek pahnaemh kaminawk hoi angkom oh. Aling hanah nangmah hoi nangmah to palungha kami ah poek hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi kawbaktih doeh kasae to kasae hoi pathok hmah. Kaminawk boih hma ah kahoih hmuen poekhaih to tawn ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Angcoeng thaih nahaeloe, kami boih hoi angcoeng thaih thung, karaem ah khosah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Palung ih kaminawk, nangmacae mah roe lu la o hmah, Sithaw palungphuihaih phak hanah ahmuen pahoe pae oh: Cabu thungah, lu lakhaih loe Kai ih ni; Kai mah lu Ka lak han, tiah Angraeng mah thuih ih lok to oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />To pongah, Na misa to zok amthlam nahaeloe, anih to buh pacah ah, tui anghae nahaeloe, anih han tui paek ah: to tiah na sak nahaeloe, a lu nuiah hmai kamngaeh na koeng pae baktiah ni om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kahoih ai hmuen mah pazawksak hmah, kahoih ai hmuen to kahoih hmuen hoiah pazawk ah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinghaih tawnh kami boih mah akaa tawn ukkung ih lok to tahngai o nasoe. Sithaw mah paek ai ah loe sakthaihaih om ai: sakthaihaih akaa tawn kaminawk loe Sithaw mah paek ih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />To pongah mi kawbaktih doeh sakthaihaih tawn kaminawk ih lokaek kami loe, Sithaw khokhanhaih aek kami ah oh, lokaek kaminawk loe lokcaekhaih hnu o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kahoih hmuen sah kami mah loe ukkungnawk to zit han om ai, toe kasae hmuen sah kaminawk hanah loe zit thoh. Ukkungnawk zii ai ah oh han na koeh o maw? Kahoih hmuen to sah ah, to tih nahaeloe nihcae pakoehhaih to na hnu tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kahoih hmuen sak hanah, anih loe nangcae khaeah Sithaw toksah kami ah oh. Toe kahoih ai hmuen na sak nahaeloe, zii ah; anih loe sumsen to azom ah angnaengh ai: anih loe kahoih ai hmuen sah kami nuiah palungphui hoiah lokcaek, lu lakung Sithaw toksah kami ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />To pongah palungphuihaih zit khue ai ah, kasae kahoih panoekhaih hoiah doeh ukkung tlim ah na kun han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hae tiah oh pongah tamut doeh na paek o han oh: nihcae loe Sithaw toksah kami ah oh o baktih toengah, boeng ai ah tok to a sak o poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To pongah kami boih mah paek han koi kaom hmuen to paek oh: tamut paek han koi kami khaeah tamut to paek oh; hmuen tho paek han koi kami khaeah atho to paek oh; zit han koi kami to zii oh; pakoeh koi kami to pakoeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maeto hoi maeto amlung oh, laiba tawn o hmah: minawk kalah palung kami loe kaalok to koepsak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaalok pongah, Na zu sava laep ah zaehaih sah hmah, Kami hum hmah, Paqu hmah, Amsawn hnukung ah om hmah, Ut hmah, tiah oh; kalah kaalok to om vop nahaeloe, to kaaloknawk loe, Na imtaeng kami to na takpum baktih toengah palung ah, tiah thuih ih hae kaalok thungah akun boih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amlunghaih mah imtaeng kami amrosak ai: to pongah amlunghaih loe kaalok akoephaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aicae pahlonghaih loe, aicae mah tanghaih a tawnh o tangsuek nathuem ih pongah doeh, vaihiah anghnaih kue: vaihi loe iih angthawkhaih atue boeh ni, atue to panoek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aqum boeng tom boeh moe, khodai tom boeh: to pongah khoving toksakhaih to va o si loe, aanghaih maiphaw maica to angkhuk o si boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Poih sakhaih, mu paquihaih, taksa koehhaih, zae sak koehhaih, angaekhaih, uthaihnawk to ayae moe, khodai thungah a oh o baktih toengah, toenghaih hoiah caeh o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Angraeng Jesu Kri to angkhuk oh, taksa koehhaih akoepsak hanah, taksa khaeah angpaek o hmah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tanghaih bangah thahnaem kaminawk to talawk oh, toe palunghaengh koi kaom hmuennawk pongah loe nihcae hoi lok angaek o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kami maeto mah loe hmuennawk boih caak thaih, tiah tanghaih a tawnh: toe kalah tanghaih thazok kami maeto mah loe aan khue ni a caak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah anih to talawk boeh pongah, caa kami mah caa ai kami to patoek hmah nasoe; caa ai kami mah doeh caa kami to lokcaek hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minawk ih tamna lokcaek kami nang loe mi aa? Angmah ih angraeng mah khue ni anih loe katoeng kami maw, katoeng ai kami, tiah lokcaek thai tih. Ue, Sithaw mah loe anih to toengsak thaih pongah, anih to toengsak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kami maeto mah loe ani maeto pongah loe kalah ani to hoih kue, tiah poek: kalah kami mah loe ani loe anghmong boih, tiah poek. Kami boih a poekhaih baktiah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani zaa kami loe Angraeng han ih ni a zaah; ani zaa ai kami loe, Angraeng hanah zaa ai. Kacaa kami loe, Angraeng ah a caak pongah, Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lok to thuih; kacaa ai kami loe, Angraeng ah caa ai pongah, Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lok thui ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aicae loe angmah han khue a hing o ai, angmah han khue a dueh o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hing o nahaeloe, Angraeng ah ni a hing o; a duek o cadoeh, Angraeng ah ni a duek o: to pongah, a hing o cadoeh, a duek o cadoeh, aicae loe Angraeng ih qawk ah ni a oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kri loe kadueh kami hoi kahing kami ih Angraeng ah oh thai hanah, a duek, angthawk let moe, a hing let boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aicae loe Kri lokcaekhaih tangkhang hmaa ah angdoe boih tih, to tiah nahaeloe tih hanah nam nawkamya to lok na caek loe? To tih ai boeh loe tih hanah nam nawkamya to na khet patoek loe?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cabu thungah, Kai ka hing pongah, kami boih ka hmaa ah khokkhu cangkrawn o tih, kami boih mah Sithaw to taphong o tih, tiah Angraeng mah thuih ih lok tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To naah aicae boih mah Anih kawng to Sithaw hmaa ah taphong o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />To pongah aicae mah maeto hoi maeto lokcaek o hma lai si: toe mi kawbaktih doeh nawkamya amtimh han ih maw, to tih ai boeh loe amthaek han ih maw sah o hma si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Angraeng Jesu tanghaih rang hoiah, Kawbaktih caaknaek doeh angmah koehah amhnong ai, tiah a panoek o: toe ciimcai ai, tiah poek kami hanah loe, to hmuen to ciim ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe na caak ih buh pongah nawkamya palung na setsak nahaeloe, nang loe amlunghaih hoiah khosah kami na ai vop ni. Anih hanah Kri duek boeh pongah na caak ih buh hoiah anih to amrosak hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na hoihhaih to kasae thuihaih ah om hmah nasoe:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sithaw mah siangpahrang ah uk ih prae loe caak naekhaih ahmuen na ai ni; Kacai Muithla ah toenghaih, angdaehhaih hoi anghoehaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To tiah Kri toksah kami loe Sithaw hmaa ah tapom han koiah oh, kaminawk mah pakoeh han koiah doeh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />To pongah aicae loe angdaehhaih hoi kami qoengsak thaih hmuen to patom o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Caaknaekhaih hoiah Sithaw toksakhaih to amrosak hmah. Hmuen boih loe ciim; toe kami amtimsak hanah caak to hoih ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nam nawkamya amtimsak hanah loe moi doeh, misurtui doeh, kawbaktih caaknaeknawk doeh caak han om ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tanghaih na tawnh maw? Na tawnh nahaeloe nangmah hanah Sithaw hmaa ah tawn ah. A koeh moe, sak ih hmuen pongah angmah hoi angmah lok angcaek ai kami loe tahamhoih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toe palunghaenghaih hoiah caa kami loe, tanghaih palung hoiah caa ai pongah, zaehaih a tawnh: to pongah tanghaih hoiah sah ai ih hmuen boih loe zaehaih ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tha kacak aicae loe aimacae koehhaih to pazui ai ah, tanghaih bangah thahnaem kaminawk to abomh han angaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A imtaeng kami to hoihhaih bangah qoengsak hanah, anih koehhaih to paroi pae o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kri mah mataeng doeh Angmah koehhaih to sah ai; Nang kasae thui kaminawk ih lok loe ka nuiah krak boeh, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cabu thungah kaom palungsawkhaih hoi pathloephaih rang hoiah oephaih a tawnh o thai hanah, canghnii ah tarik ih hmuennawk boih loe aicae amtukhaih han ih ni tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kri Jesu koehhaih baktiah, palungsawkhaih, pathloephaih hoiah kakoi Sithaw mah maeto hoi maeto poek anghmonghaih to nangcae khaeah paek nasoe:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />to tiah ni aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih Ampa, Sithaw to poekhaih maeto, pahni palai maeto hoiah na pakoeh o thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To pongah Kri mah Sithaw lensawkhaih ah ang talawk o baktih toengah, nangcae doeh maeto hoi maeto talawk o toeng ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Kri loe ampanawk khaeah sak ih loktang Sithaw lokkamhaih to caksak hanah, tangyat hin aat kaminawk ih toksahkung ah oh, tiah ka thuih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anih ih palungnathaih rang hoiah ni Gentelnawk mah Sithaw to pakoeh o thai tih, Hae pongah Gentelnawk salakah nang to kang pakoeh han, na hmin pakoehhaih laa ka sak han, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pacoengah, Nangcae Gentelnawk, Anih ih kaminawk hoi nawnto anghoe oh, tiah a thuih let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To pacoengah, Nangcae Gentelnawk boih, Angraeng to pakoeh oh; nangcae acaeng kaminawk boih Anih pakoehhaih laa to sah oh, tiah a thuih let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To pacoengah, Isaiah mah doeh, Gentelnawk uk boih hanah, Jesse ih tangzun hoi tacawt Kami to angzo tih; Gentelnawk mah Anih nuiah oephaih tawn o tih, tiah thuih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kacai Muithla thacakhaih rang hoiah kapop aep anghoehaih na tawnh o thai hanah, tanghaih na tawnh o pongah oephaih paekkung Sithaw mah, anghoehaih hoi monghaih hoiah na koi o sak nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae loe hoihhaih hoiah na koi o, palunghahaih hoiah na koep o moe, maeto hoi maeto thuitaekhaih na tawnh o, tito ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe Sithaw mah kai khaeah tahmenhaih paek baktih toengah, nangcae panoeksak let han ka koeh pongah, misa hoihhaih hoiah ca kang tarik o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gentelnawk khaeah Jesu Kri toksahkung ah ka oh baktih toengah, kahoih Sithaw ih tamthanglok to ka taphong. To tiah ni Gentelnawk mah paek ih hmuennawk to Kacai Muithla mah ciimcaisak ueloe, talawk pae thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />To pongah Sithaw toksakhaih bangah loe Kri Jesu ah amoek thaihaih to ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kri mah kai patohhaih rang hoiah toksakhaih om ai nahaeloe, lokthuihhaih hoi toksakhaih rang hoiah Gentelnawk lok tahngaisak hanah, to loknawk to ka thui rumram thai mak ai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sithaw Muithla thacakhaih rang hoiah, thacak angmathaih hoi dawnrai hmuennawk to ka sak; Jerusalem hoiah Illyricum khoek to kahoih Kri tamthanglok to ka taphong boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ue, kai loe Kri tamthanglok thaih ai kaminawk khaeah tamthanglok taphong han ih ni kam sak; to tih ai nahaeloe kalah kami mah sak tangcae ih ahmuen ah imsah kami ah ka om moeng tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih kawng thuih ai ih kaminawk mah, Anih to hnu o tih; kathaih vai ai kaminawk mah thaikophaih to tawn o tih, tiah tarik ih oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />To tiah oh pongah nangcae khaeah kang zo thai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe hae prae ah toksak han om ai boeh, saning paroeai thung nangcae khae angzoh han koehhaih ka tawnh pongah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain prae ah ka caeh naah loe, nangcae khaeah kang zoh han: kholong ka caehhaih pangah, nangcae hoi nawnto angkom hmaloe han, to pacoengah, kholong ka caehhaih loklam ah kai nang thak o tih, tiah tiah oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toe vaihi loe Jerusalem ah kaom kaciim kaminawk abom hanah ka caeh vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Macedonia hoi Akaia ih kaminawk mah Jerusalem ah kaom amtang kaciim kaminawk hanah amlunghaih hoiah hmuenmae a paek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nihcae loe to baktih abomhaih tok sak han koeh o; nihcae mah Judahnawk hanah hmuenmae hoi abomhaih loe laiba pathok baktiah ni oh. Judahnawk mah angmacae Muithla tahamhoihaih to Gentelnawk han pazet o baktih toengah, Gentelnawk mah doeh angmacae taksa tahamhoihaih to Judahnawk han paek o toeng han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />To pongah, hae tok ka sak moe, abom ih hae hmuenmae hae nihcae khaeah ka paek pacoengah loe, Spain prae caehhaih pangah, nangcae khaeah kang zoh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangcae khae kang zoh naah, kahoih Kri tamthanglok ah kaom kakoi tahamhoihhaih hoiah ni kang zoh han, tiah ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, Angraeng Jesu Kri hoi Muithla amlunghaih rang hoiah, nawnto lawk a thuih o moe, Sithaw khaeah lawk nang thuih pae o hanah kang pacae o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />katang ai Judea prae kaminawk ban thung hoiah ka loih thaih moe, Jerusalem ah kaom kaciim kaminawk mah ka tok sakhaih talawk o thai hanah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sithaw koehhaih baktiah anghoehaih hoiah nangcae khaeah kang zoh moe, nangcae hoi nawnto poekhaih kangtha hoi khosak thai hanah lawkthui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sithaw monghaih nangcae boih hoi nawnto om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cenkhrae vangpui ih kricaabu thungah tamna ah kaom, aicae tanuh Phoebe pakoehhaih lok kang thuih o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangcae mah anih to Angraeng ah kaciim kami ah talawk oh loe, nangcae khaeah angtoenghaih tawn nahaeloe, anih to abom oh: anih loe paroeai kaminawk hoi kai bomkung ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kri Jesu ah kai hoi tok nawnto sah kami, Priscilla hoi Aquila khaeah kawnhaih lok thui oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nihnik loe kai ka hing thai hanah, tahnong takroek han khoek to angpaek kami ah oh hoi: kai khue mah na ai, Gentel kricaanawk boih mah doeh nihnik nuiah kating ai kawnhaih tawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nihnik im ah amkhueng kricaanawk khaeah doeh kawnhaih lok to thui oh. Kam pui Epeneta khaeah doeh kawnhaih lok to thui oh, anih loe Asia prae thungah Kri ah thingthai athai tangsuek ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aicae han tha pathokhaih hoiah tok sah, Meri khaeah kawnhaih lok thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai hoi nawnto thongkrah ampui, kaimah ih canawk ah doeh kaom Andronika hoi Junia hnik khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh, nihnik loe patoeh ih kaminawk salakah panoek ih kami ah a oh hoi moe, kai om ai naah Kri ah a oh hoi boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Angraeng ah ka palung ih Amplia khaeah kawnhaih lok thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kri ah aicae bomkung Urbana hoi ka palung ih Stachy khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kri hnukah bang tangtang, Apelle hoi Aristobula imthung takohnawk khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kaimah ih canawk ah kaom Herodion khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh. Angraeng ah kaom Narcissa imthung takohnawk khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Angraeng ah toksak tha pathok nongpata hnik, Tryphena hoi Tryphosa khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh. Angraeng ah paroeai toksak tha pathok palung ih nongpata Persi khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Angraeng ah qoih ih kami Rufu hoi anih ih amno, kai ih amno ah doeh oh, anih khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asyncrita, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Herma hoi nawnto kaom nawkamyanawk khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philologu, Julia, Nereu hoi a tanuh, Olympa hoi toah kaom kaciim kaminawk boih khaeah kawnhaih lok to thui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maeto hoi maeto kaciim mokhaih hoiah kawnhaih lok to thui oh. Kricaabunawk mah nangcae han kawnhaih lok ang thuih pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nam tuk o ih loklam hoiah amkhraeng, ampraekhaih hoi lok angaekhaih tacawtsak thaih kaminawk to panoek oh loe, nihcae to ayae hanah kang pacae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nihcae loe aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih tok to sah o ai, angmacae zok amhahhaih tok ni a sak o; lok kahoih a thuih o moe, lokthuih kophaih hoiah kahoih poekhaih tawn kaminawk to aling o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangcae lok tahngaihaih loe kaminawk boih khaeah phak boeh. To pongah nangcae zuengah kating ai kawnhaih ka tawnh: toe kahoih hmuen pongah palunghahaih na tawnh o moe, kahoih ai hmuen bangah zaehaih panoek ai kami ah na oh o hanah kang koeh o haih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Angdaehhaih Sithaw mah akra ai ah Setan to nangcae khok tlim ah atii tih boeh. Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tok nawnto ka sak haih ampui Timote, kaimah ih kami ah kaom Lucia, Jason hoi Sosipata mah doeh kawnhaih lok ang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hae ca tarik kami kai, Tertia mah doeh Angraeng ah kawnhaih lok kang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kai hoi haeah kaom kricaa khenzawnkung, caaknaek pacahkung Kaia mah doeh kawnhaih lok ang thuih o. Vangpui ih hmuenmae pakuemkung Erasta hoi nangcae ih amnawk, Quarta mah doeh kawnhaih lok ang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih nangcae boih khaeah om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Long oh tangsuek nathuem hoi tamquta ah suek ih kathuk hmuen amtuenghaih baktih, ka thuih ih kahoih tamthanglok hoi Jesu Kri ih tamthanglok taphonghaih baktih toengah, nangcae thacaksak thaih Anih mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />dungzan kahing Sithaw lokpaekhaih baktih toengah, tahmaanawk ih Cabu rang hoiah a tang o moe, a lok tahngaih pae o hanah, prae kruek ih kaminawk khaeah vaihi amtuengsak boeh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu Kri rang hoiah palungha Sithaw khae khue ah, dungzan khoek to lensawkhaih om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
